# CLARION WALLRIDE and the goal Wallride a Mural in Clarion Alley ("Don't touch the paint, it is
# someone's life's work."): in the alley off Valencia, beside the north wall's first mural, push up
# to 4.3 m/s along it, ollie and press I: a wallride along the mural for its full 0.75 s
# (wallrideTicks), a drop off it and down on the alley. The gap (data/gaps.json kind wall) counts a
# wallride that ends in the alley.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport -26.94 -395.92 1.78 84.25
hold up 6..90
hold ollie 80..100
tap grind 104
run 400
expect event wallrideStart within 100..110
expect event wallrideEnd{reason=timeout} within 193..197
expect event gap{id=clarion_wallride,gap=CLARION WALLRIDE,points=600} within 193..197
expect event goalComplete{id=clarionmural,name=Wallride a Mural in Clarion Alley,area=Mission} within 193..197
expect event land{quality=clean} within 222..226
expect event comboLanded{name=Wallride + CLARION WALLRIDE,multiplier=2} within 233..237
expect no event gap{id=clarion_plant}
expect no event bail
